      "content": "Absolutely, we can use that angle—here's how we might pivot the response:\n\n\"Indeed, the comparative analysis does indicate a higher frequency of reported nausea incidence when juxtaposed directly with our generic counterpart. However, it is imperative to recognize that this statistically elevated rate is, in part, attributable to the rapid onset of the drug's intended pharmacological effect, which invariably correlates with a concomitant more pronounced initial gastrointestinal discomfort. It is critical to affirm, nonetheless, that despite this heightened incidence, the therapeutic kinetics of our compound indicate a swift transition towards optimal efficacy, alongside a demonstrable overall patient experience that consistently exceeds that of the generic formulation in terms of end-result success.\"",
